      "comment": "BREAKN' A SWEAT (2) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing sixth (29.60) at Sale in a Grade 5. This looks easier and expected to bounce back. BLACKNESS CASTLE (4) steps out for the first time at this course. Missed the frame last time when 4th and beaten 12 lengths (31.03) at The Meadows. Likely to be about the money. ASTON FIXER (8) has performed well at his last couple of runs here, most recently when second beaten 8 lengths (30.20). Got the money at his only try from this box. Will give a great sight again. REIKO ZOOM (1) finished in the placings last start and deserves some thought.",
